\"><span>Loftet Studentinkubator</span></a><span> (Kristiania&rsquo;s own incubator for students who have a business idea or a startup).</span></p>\n<p><!--EndFragment-->"}},{"heading":{"value":"Campus Life"},"content":{"value":"Kristiania is a place for everyone, whilst being a place where you will study along with others who share your passions.&nbsp;An education from Kristiania is practice-oriented, which makes our students sought-after in the labour market, even before they have finished their education. The students' own line associations make for opportunities to meet and bond on the basis of shared interests, while the incubators like Loftet and Bryggeriet creates a bustling and inspiring environment for the students' own companies.</p>\n"}}],"gobiStoryId":null,"imageFallback":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/d1fbb86e13d74cad8e0e1cf85bcfba3c/master-human-computer-interaction-1.jpg","alt":"Bildet viser en mannlig foreleser som står foran en gruppe studenter i et klasserom. Han står ved en skjerm som viser ordene \"Augmented Reality\". Studentene, som hovedsakelig er sett bakfra, bruker bærbare datamaskiner, noe som antyder at de tar notater eller deltar aktivt i leksjonen. Klasserommet ser moderne ut, med lyse vinduer i bakgrunnen.","focalPoint":{"x":0.5,"y":0.39},"lazyLoading":true},"translations":{"openPlayer":"Open player","failedToLoadVideo":"Sorry, for some reason we could not load a video"},"variant":"dark"};</script></div>
</div><div>
<div id="822e09b2"><section id="meet-the-program-director" class="cPloAW9ETJppiKf3uOg6 PS9OiuwCp_Mtf4jcUm_I"><div class="Fov3KMlE7osNR74JI44t"><div class="Wf6h4ZdN2S9XvO6RoMCf"><div class="OPDkk3SbGwWTZeDlZj4f"><div class="Za0F_aizRoRV7IW8vrhK"><span class="SvgIcon R8xM2ukm6YYDNzHE9e8V"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-quote-mark"></use></svg></span></div><div class="OBg8GbGOQ11Y_kO0y26Q"><span>With more than ten years of experience from the industry and working on European projects, I will make sure that our students get the most relevant knowledge and skills in the field of cyber security.</span></div><div class="WyTuSgXamI5tDjjbW40k"><div class="ELZbSN0xkGRxudxoCGZD Jjpdm0z1lffwiYq7tJFx"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL BsNJMoWrLSwywFoZw_rI"><picture><source sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (min-width: 480px) 350px" srcSet="/contentassets/f57aa6e0fde94c92b316bfa786cb841e/andrii-shalaginov.jpg?width=350 350w, /contentassets/f57aa6e0fde94c92b316bfa786cb841e/andrii-shalaginov.jpg?width=470 470w"/><img src="/contentassets/f57aa6e0fde94c92b316bfa786cb841e/andrii-shalaginov.jpg?width=258" alt="Andrii Shalaginov" style="object-position:61% 28.000000000000004%" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="wgsfEYhliRuQ3OGsPPB7"><a href="/en/about-kristiania/employees/fakultet-for-helse-og-teknologi/department-of-technology/andrii-shalaginov/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi A9IrxP6x1kHMxJBX5nkl" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><span class="PafA02TiaN5DOnBONInU">Andrii Shalaginov</span><span class="C7aWfJ5wcSGxkMQk5mVC"><ul class="ybs02MiIsdu5yS7LYwML"><li class="MkfboJs3JDCOgTmDA6XY">Professor</li></ul><span class="WNOGE5Zjbw73YZqwUfmg">Department of Technology</span></span></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['822e09b2-json'] = {"id":"meet-the-program-director","quote":{"value":"<span>With more than ten years of experience from the industry and working on European projects, I will make sure that our students get the most relevant knowledge and skills in the field of cyber security.</span>"},"employeeInfo":{"name":"Andrii Shalaginov","picture":{"profile":{"defaultWidth":258,"format":"preserve","maxImageDimension":null,"sources":[{"mediaCondition":null,"allowedWidths":[350,470],"sizes":["(max-width: 479px) 100vw","(min-width: 480px) 350px"],"mode":"default","targetAspectRatio":{"ratio":-1,"hasValue":false},"quality":{"quality":-1}}]},"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/f57aa6e0fde94c92b316bfa786cb841e/andrii-shalaginov.jpg","alt":"Andrii Shalaginov","focalPoint":{"x":0.61,"y":0.28},"lazyLoading":true},"jobTitles":["Professor"],"department":"Department of Technology","organization":"Kristiania University of Applied Sciences","link":{"label":"Andrii Shalaginov","href":"/en/about-kristiania/employees/fakultet-for-helse-og-teknologi/department-of-technology/andrii-shalaginov/","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}},"variant":"red"};</script></div>
</div><div>
<div id="ba8d5341"><section id="this-is-the-application-process" class="NnFtz8yGDNGgm4iXtNTA mNPOnqSYSg5fB3hFZFBL uhYaMSQDrGni1cKDFsLT"><div class="Fov3KMlE7osNR74JI44t"><div class="Wf6h4ZdN2S9XvO6RoMCf"><h2 class="FrR9v_ssranAjR5kDzwF p7xl62mHk9cu52oWqtzj">This is the application process</h2><div class="Qr_bydYPAMBGRcTc8g3A"><div class="Q4l24cbBS_P0H6xU1dCm RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark">Here you will find important information about the application process and how you can best prepare for the start of your studies.</div></div><div class="dRTaaYN3ZUOGkvUTID_V"><div class="zcuZKWJNQG9sdTxbSyML UPddEtslXEXlHwduN5H6"><div class="pvts98xa0OkTLpIU1H_7"><button aria-label="Scroll to the beginning" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT eWHGi6Mny_JULzuSiA9c nKRCOZxozB9q4kVkNbC9"><span class="SvgIcon o7btmPNnqHIC4HVcB9dW"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-chevron-left"></use></svg></span></button><div role="tablist" class="jp3mlTjnWllHYH08nQlW Wx5bXIVB15ZoMKXfA5H5 QqfABz0jv7crGhqvIJlQ" aria-label="This is the application process"><button id="tab_tab-1206" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="tabPanel_tab-1206" type="button" class="zbh0qfHfBsYc5dxA3h5a Ny2XmdzuJKxD96WqEGuz">When applying</button><button id="tab_tab-1207" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tabPanel_tab-1207" type="button" class="zbh0qfHfBsYc5dxA3h5a">After admission acceptance</button><button id="tab_tab-1208" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tabPanel_tab-1208" type="button" class="zbh0qfHfBsYc5dxA3h5a">Starting your studies</button></div><button aria-label="Scroll to the end" type="button" class="NtmtjnwY8FdZxOUBkRwT eWHGi6Mny_JULzuSiA9c bPqgZ6BxIluZSVVXRd91"><span class="SvgIcon o7btmPNnqHIC4HVcB9dW"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-chevron-right"></use></svg></span></button></div></div><div class="jaWakwTlr083IlabBh3w"><div id="tabPanel_tab-1206" class="pIVKSl48xvxhvIFaVOWG" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab_tab-1206"><ul class="VphcdOhVwpXxhvvPmAiw"><li><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="fW7BjZXoaXbSWeqUTxGB _p6utBGm9dNd5z3_Zqa2 LmkNaNqgeL9tRmSZSQEw lPTNRKMIaRtTkcBpsbyw"><h3 class="eALIYeXTWaMdoAl95ChI">Important deadlines</h3><div class="ngto1lep4Jqeq0RnHHLJ RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark ltzsAOJkolz790xTYqeY"><span>The application deadline is April 15. The deadline for submitting diplomas and certificates is July 1.</span></div><a href="/en/study-at-kristiania/admission-information/#praktiskinformasjon" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi geY8iJSFnAov0Sq77FMv" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><span class="visuallyHidden">Read more</span><span class="SvgIcon us4kACIbMAE6qyr9G6zl"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right-circle"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></li><li><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="fW7BjZXoaXbSWeqUTxGB _p6utBGm9dNd5z3_Zqa2 LmkNaNqgeL9tRmSZSQEw lPTNRKMIaRtTkcBpsbyw"><h3 class="eALIYeXTWaMdoAl95ChI">How to apply</h3><div class="ngto1lep4Jqeq0RnHHLJ RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark ltzsAOJkolz790xTYqeY"><a href="https://minside.kristiania.no/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Min Side for s&oslash;kere</a>&nbsp;is where you accept the offer and upload necessary documentation for your qualifications.</div><a href="/studere-hos-oss/for-sokere/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi geY8iJSFnAov0Sq77FMv" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><span class="visuallyHidden">Read more</span><span class="SvgIcon us4kACIbMAE6qyr9G6zl"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right-circle"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></li><li><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="fW7BjZXoaXbSWeqUTxGB _p6utBGm9dNd5z3_Zqa2 LmkNaNqgeL9tRmSZSQEw lPTNRKMIaRtTkcBpsbyw"><h3 class="eALIYeXTWaMdoAl95ChI">Processing time</h3><div class="ngto1lep4Jqeq0RnHHLJ RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark ltzsAOJkolz790xTYqeY">For study programs with rolling admissions, you will receive a conditional offer within 1&ndash;3 days of submitting the application, if there are available slots for the study program you applied for.</div><a href="/en/study-at-kristiania/admission-information/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi geY8iJSFnAov0Sq77FMv" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><span class="visuallyHidden">Read more</span><span class="SvgIcon us4kACIbMAE6qyr9G6zl"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right-circle"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></li></ul></div><div id="tabPanel_tab-1207" class="pIVKSl48xvxhvIFaVOWG gtro7ZD8xMPr5ZbrapYm" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab_tab-1207"><ul class="VphcdOhVwpXxhvvPmAiw"><li><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="fW7BjZXoaXbSWeqUTxGB _p6utBGm9dNd5z3_Zqa2 LmkNaNqgeL9tRmSZSQEw lPTNRKMIaRtTkcBpsbyw"><h3 class="eALIYeXTWaMdoAl95ChI">Semester registration</h3><div class="ngto1lep4Jqeq0RnHHLJ RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark ltzsAOJkolz790xTYqeY">You must register and confirm your individual education plan before you are reported as an active student to the Norwegian State Educational Loan Fund, and to gain access to your subjects in Canvas,&nbsp;the learning platform.</div><a href="https://fsweb.no/studentweb/login.jsf?inst=FSHK" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi geY8iJSFnAov0Sq77FMv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><span class="visuallyHidden">Read more</span><span class="SvgIcon us4kACIbMAE6qyr9G6zl"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right-circle"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></li><li><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="fW7BjZXoaXbSWeqUTxGB _p6utBGm9dNd5z3_Zqa2 LmkNaNqgeL9tRmSZSQEw lPTNRKMIaRtTkcBpsbyw"><h3 class="eALIYeXTWaMdoAl95ChI">SiO (Oslo) and Sammen (Bergen)</h3><div class="ngto1lep4Jqeq0RnHHLJ RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark ltzsAOJkolz790xTYqeY">SiO and Sammen offers housing, health services, kindergardens, fitness centers and much more to its members.</div><a href="/en/for-students/student-welfare-organisations/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi geY8iJSFnAov0Sq77FMv" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><span class="visuallyHidden">Read more</span><span class="SvgIcon us4kACIbMAE6qyr9G6zl"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right-circle"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></li><li><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="fW7BjZXoaXbSWeqUTxGB _p6utBGm9dNd5z3_Zqa2 LmkNaNqgeL9tRmSZSQEw lPTNRKMIaRtTkcBpsbyw"><h3 class="eALIYeXTWaMdoAl95ChI">Loans and grants</h3><div class="ngto1lep4Jqeq0RnHHLJ RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark ltzsAOJkolz790xTYqeY">All our study programs are&nbsp;publicly approved and give the right to apply for loans and grants from the&nbsp;Norwegian State Educational Loan Fund (<a href="https://www.lanekassen.no/nb-NO/Languages/About-the-Norwegian-State-Educational-Loan-Fund-/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">L&aring;nekassen</a>).</div><a href="/en/study-at-kristiania/admission-information/#praktiskinformasjon" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi geY8iJSFnAov0Sq77FMv" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><span class="visuallyHidden">Read more</span><span class="SvgIcon us4kACIbMAE6qyr9G6zl"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right-circle"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></li></ul></div><div id="tabPanel_tab-1208" class="pIVKSl48xvxhvIFaVOWG gtro7ZD8xMPr5ZbrapYm" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab_tab-1208"><ul class="VphcdOhVwpXxhvvPmAiw"><li><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="fW7BjZXoaXbSWeqUTxGB _p6utBGm9dNd5z3_Zqa2 LmkNaNqgeL9tRmSZSQEw lPTNRKMIaRtTkcBpsbyw"><h3 class="eALIYeXTWaMdoAl95ChI">Services and adaptations</h3><div class="ngto1lep4Jqeq0RnHHLJ RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark ltzsAOJkolz790xTYqeY">As a student, you can get guidance, everyday adaptation and follow-up on study-related questions and challenges. We have a duty of confidentiality.</div><a href="/en/for-students/student-services/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi geY8iJSFnAov0Sq77FMv" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><span class="visuallyHidden">Read more</span><span class="SvgIcon us4kACIbMAE6qyr9G6zl"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right-circle"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></li><li><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="fW7BjZXoaXbSWeqUTxGB _p6utBGm9dNd5z3_Zqa2 LmkNaNqgeL9tRmSZSQEw lPTNRKMIaRtTkcBpsbyw"><h3 class="eALIYeXTWaMdoAl95ChI">Mitt Kristiania</h3><div class="ngto1lep4Jqeq0RnHHLJ RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark ltzsAOJkolz790xTYqeY">This is where you get an overview of your schedule, syllabus, services and other tools you need as a student.</div><a href="/en/mitt-kristiania/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi geY8iJSFnAov0Sq77FMv" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><span class="visuallyHidden">Mitt Kristiania</span><span class="SvgIcon us4kACIbMAE6qyr9G6zl"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right-circle"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></li><li><div role="none" tabindex="-1" class="fW7BjZXoaXbSWeqUTxGB _p6utBGm9dNd5z3_Zqa2 LmkNaNqgeL9tRmSZSQEw lPTNRKMIaRtTkcBpsbyw"><h3 class="eALIYeXTWaMdoAl95ChI">Student ID card</h3><div class="ngto1lep4Jqeq0RnHHLJ RichtextContent RichtextContent--dark ltzsAOJkolz790xTYqeY">As a new student, you can have a student card made on all our campuses except the Brenneriveien Campus. Your student card serves as an access card at the college&rsquo;s campuses, ID for exams, payment card for printers and library card.</div><a href="/en/for-students/reception-services/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi geY8iJSFnAov0Sq77FMv" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><span class="visuallyHidden">Read more</span><span class="SvgIcon us4kACIbMAE6qyr9G6zl"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right-circle"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['ba8d5341-json'] = {"id":"this-is-the-application-process","heading":{"value":"This is the application process"},"teaser":{"value":"Here you will find important information about the application process and how you can best prepare for the start of your studies."},"tabsLabel":"This is the application process","tabs":[{"heading":"When applying","items":[{"heading":{"value":"Important deadlines"},"content":{"value":"<span>The application deadline is April 15. The deadline for submitting diplomas and certificates is July 1.</span>"},"link":{"label":"Read more","href":"/en/study-at-kristiania/admission-information/#praktiskinformasjon","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}},{"heading":{"value":"How to apply"},"content":{"value":"<a href=\"https://minside.kristiania.no/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Min Side for s&oslash;kere</a>&nbsp;is where you accept the offer and upload necessary documentation for your qualifications."},"link":{"label":"Read more","href":"/studere-hos-oss/for-sokere/","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}},{"heading":{"value":"Processing time"},"content":{"value":"For study programs with rolling admissions, you will receive a conditional offer within 1&ndash;3 days of submitting the application, if there are available slots for the study program you applied for."},"link":{"label":"Read more","href":"/en/study-at-kristiania/admission-information/","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}}]},{"heading":"After admission acceptance","items":[{"heading":{"value":"Semester registration"},"content":{"value":"You must register and confirm your individual education plan before you are reported as an active student to the Norwegian State Educational Loan Fund, and to gain access to your subjects in Canvas,&nbsp;the learning platform."},"link":{"label":"Read more","href":"https://fsweb.no/studentweb/login.jsf?inst=FSHK","external":true,"showIsExternal":true}},{"heading":{"value":"SiO (Oslo) and Sammen (Bergen)"},"content":{"value":"SiO and Sammen offers housing, health services, kindergardens, fitness centers and much more to its members."},"link":{"label":"Read more","href":"/en/for-students/student-welfare-organisations/","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}},{"heading":{"value":"Loans and grants"},"content":{"value":"All our study programs are&nbsp;publicly approved and give the right to apply for loans and grants from the&nbsp;Norwegian State Educational Loan Fund (<a href=\"https://www.lanekassen.no/nb-NO/Languages/About-the-Norwegian-State-Educational-Loan-Fund-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">L&aring;nekassen</a>)."},"link":{"label":"Read more","href":"/en/study-at-kristiania/admission-information/#praktiskinformasjon","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}}]},{"heading":"Starting your studies","items":[{"heading":{"value":"Services and adaptations"},"content":{"value":"As a student, you can get guidance, everyday adaptation and follow-up on study-related questions and challenges. We have a duty of confidentiality."},"link":{"label":"Read more","href":"/en/for-students/student-services/","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}},{"heading":{"value":"Mitt Kristiania"},"content":{"value":"This is where you get an overview of your schedule, syllabus, services and other tools you need as a student."},"link":{"label":"Mitt Kristiania","href":"/en/mitt-kristiania/","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}},{"heading":{"value":"Student ID card"},"content":{"value":"As a new student, you can have a student card made on all our campuses except the Brenneriveien Campus. Your student card serves as an access card at the college&rsquo;s campuses, ID for exams, payment card for printers and library card."},"link":{"label":"Read more","href":"/en/for-students/reception-services/","external":false,"showIsExternal":true}}]}],"translations":{"scrollStart":"Scroll to the beginning","scrollEnd":"Scroll to the end"}};</script></div>
</div><div>
<div id="c3c9acfc"><div id="any-questions" class="gczKN2pSjSR2BtQk5kWK"><div class="BHZEJUDSIPpKa0oPrsHx HKWJI6twVeF2fy35QptA CBihJp3agVQXhuKWcUyR FVBK8j1w9sq6TzHiDhBX dWbYLRuudKTJ6z54CyqI"><div class="bLAdaCckoHBaiIC97_jU uwdDbr8iIUnkWFMVwpIF"><div class="eh99tHo126OqTC2jRbLr"><div class="on3wNZn_jvWu7KfVfYv6"><div class="nlqrHsVbqtUwDBhbo7sE"><h2 class="pkRgi6LaSk6BZGRyxw9q">Any questions?</h2><div class="BlbzcwJ6hZiKvNivWB4s">Our student ambassadors are happy to answer you &ndash; either by phone, chat, video or email.</div></div><a href="https://outlook.office.com/book/Bookstudyguidance@egms.onmicrosoft.com/?ae=true&amp;login_hint" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm UssovIOXlEuxxbOHY4c4 yEK9biWpMxeKit4W3SEn hk2sUgQrAH9UK8YJmMUQ Pf5HgbFCxXwoDDfyfLsp I0dQ9KoNo8oj51pfedVE cJMgeHEGyMPOPNoeRPfY" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><span>Book a meeting</span><span class="SvgIcon"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></div></div><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL dabmDRgUTnFwXNJ_grkU"><picture><source sizes="100vw" srcSet="/globalassets/redaksjonen---blokker-til-artikler/blockbilder-global/spor-en-student-studieveiledning-content-card-global.jpg?width=375 375w, /globalassets/redaksjonen---blokker-til-artikler/blockbilder-global/spor-en-student-studieveiledning-content-card-global.jpg?width=480 480w, /globalassets/redaksjonen---blokker-til-artikler/blockbilder-global/spor-en-student-studieveiledning-content-card-global.jpg?width=640 640w, /globalassets/redaksjonen---blokker-til-artikler/blockbilder-global/spor-en-student-studieveiledning-content-card-global.jpg?width=768 768w, /globalassets/redaksjonen---blokker-til-artikler/blockbilder-global/spor-en-student-studieveiledning-content-card-global.jpg?width=1024 1024w, /globalassets/redaksjonen---blokker-til-artikler/blockbilder-global/spor-en-student-studieveiledning-content-card-global.jpg?width=1440 1440